Package: biomarkerqc
Title: Quality Control for Clinical Biomarker Lab Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Eli", "Taylor", , "116466727+elitay152@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ingests clinical laboratory result files from multiple vendors,
    normalizes results to approved units, reconciles records across sources,
    flags duplicates and missing values, and produces a traceable quality
    control report. Designed around vectorized operations so checks scale to
    large result sets.
